  "body": [
    "Register for Fall Programming! Session runs now - Nov 8.",
    "PLAY PLAY submenu Programs Private Lessons Adult Camps Summer Camps Book a Court Free30 Dave Bailey Programs",
    "EVENTS EVENTS submenu Calendar 2026 BNP Paribas World Team Cup",
    "ABOUT ABOUT submenu Meet Our Team Contact Us Sponsors & Partners USTA National Campus Scholarship",
    "WATCH WATCH submenu Watch Live Record Your Match",
    "VISIT VISIT submenu Hotel Booking Sustainability Health & Wellness Shop",
    "Home >",
    "Events >",
    "2026 BNP Paribas World Team Cup",
    "The USTA National Campus is hosting the 2026 BNP Paribas World Team Cup from September 16-19th. You're invited to experience the action up close for FREE!",
    "This year, which marks the 50th anniversary of the sport’s creation - sees the prestigious competition return to the USA, where it was first staged in 1985. You're invited to experience the action up close for FREE! Join us for a week of elite wheelchair competition and fun-filled activities! An Opening Ceremony will kick off the tournament on Tuesday, September 15 at 4:00 PM on Championship Court 1, featuring a Parade of Nations and anthem performance.",
    "Qualified Countries",
    "Draws",
    "USA",
