    "CHINA",
    "SWITZERLAND",
    "AUSTRALIA",
    "Join us for an engaging, one-day workshop designed to turn you into a confident wheelchair tennis coach.",
    "Join us for a FREE Military Tennis Clinic from 10:00 AM - 11:30 AM to get active, learn new skills, and connect with fellow service members and families.",
    "Join SOUL Ambassador Ana from Studio SOUL for a revitalizing 50-minute Vinyasa Yoga flow to launch our Community Day celebrations!",
    "Bring the whole crew out for a morning of local fun! Enjoy FREE on-court activities for all ages and skill levels, face painting for the kids, and more.",
    "Take the guesswork out of booking your Orlando/Lake Nona hotel stay with USTA Travel. Whether you’re staying for an event or are visiting the USTA National Campus, we offer a variety of hotels just right for your needs, all with amenities that make your stay comfortable and enjoyable.",
    "The National Campus is minutes from the Orlando International Airport, and area hotels offer competitive group discounts (minimum room night required).",
    "Please reach out to Grace Min at grace.min@usta.com",
    "Monday - Friday 7:00 AM - 9:00 PM",
